---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import profileImage from '../assets/profile.jpg';
---

<Base title="Matthew Rossi" section="home">

  <section class="broadsheet-body">
    <div class="col col-about">
      <span class="section-label">About</span>
      <p class="dropcap">I grew up outside Detroit — a place built almost entirely around the car. The near-total absence of alternatives made the connection between transportation and daily life hard to ignore. That stuck with me, and eventually became a serious interest in how cities move people and what happens when they can't.</p>
      <p>I spent thirteen years in software engineering, working across payments, financial services, and cloud infrastructure. Now I'm shifting focus to urban mobility through graduate study at the <a href="https://www.eiturbanmobility.eu/what-we-offer/education-and-training/masters-programmes/sustainable-urban-mobility-transitions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EIT Urban Mobility Master School</a>, starting autumn 2026.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="broadsheet-gutter" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="col col-now">
      <span class="section-label">Now</span>
      <Image
        src={profileImage}
        alt="Matthew Rossi"
        class="avatar"
        width={64}
        height={64}
        densities={[1, 2]}
        format="webp"
        quality={70}
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <p>Senior Software Engineer at <a href="https://www.heroku.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Heroku (Salesforce)</a> in New York through May 2026.</p>
      <p>Starting autumn 2026, I'll be in the <strong>EIT Urban Mobility Master's Program (SUMT)</strong> — a two-year double degree, first at Técnico Lisboa in Lisbon, then at UPC BarcelonaTech in Barcelona.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
